{"title":"내 인벤토리가 이상하다","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=SZR9a/hAJrPMvTrm/ABrtlQN0loCcZOk67Y4lQK&filename=th3","synopsis":"게임 <신들의 세상>이 현실로 변해 버리고,\n지구 전역에서 '대이동'이 일어났다.\n\n막대한 현질로 톱 티어 랭커였던 나는\n내 덕분에 기사회생한 게임 관리자 '네르'의 특전으로\n만렙 게임 캐릭터의 인벤토리를 그대로 물려받았다.\n\n아무도 구할 수 없는 현질 아이템부터\n모두가 원하는 전설 등급의 특별한 아이템까지!\n\n이제 모두가 원하는, 모든 것들이\n내 인벤토리에서 무궁무진하게 펼쳐진다.\n\n부디 당신만 알고 있기를!\n\n내 인벤토리가... 이상하다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":208,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":201,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":174,"change":{"type":"up","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":214,"change":{"type":"down","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":168,"change":{"type":"up","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":187,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":189,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":185,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":194,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":206,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":199,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":160,"change":{"type":"up","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":141,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":159,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":183,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":170,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":137,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":138,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":185,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":170,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":157,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":180,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":2